=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {p:Joulet (A)} in {z:Abyssea - La Theine} at (H-7), Veridical Conflux #04.
* Offer to mend the fishing rod. He will give you a {@i:Bkn. Willow Rod|485} {i:Broken Willow Fishing Rod|Broken Willow Fishing Rod|485}.
* Either repair the rod with a {@i:Light Crystal|4102} {i:Light Crystal|Light Crystal|4102} ({p:Woodworking} Level 10 cap), or purchase one by other means.
* Trade a {@i:Willow Fish. Rod|17391} {i:Willow Fishing Rod|Willow Fishing Rod|17391} to {p:Gallijaux (A)} at (L-12), Veridical Conflux #06, to complete the quest.
* Zoning is required to repeat this quest.
** Physically exiting the zone is required, not just logging off. The fastest way to do this will be to teleport back to Conflux #01 after quest completion, exit via the {p:Cavernous Maw}, and re-enter the zone.

